     (context . "done (e7bc0df): src/c_backend.rs, tagged-union Value runtime, one C function per lambda, self-recursive def via the same letrec-placeholder-plus-backpatch idea compiler.rs uses. Verified against the real my-lisp oracle with gcc actually compiling+running: (+ x 1) and a self-recursive count both match. Scoped down (fixed-arity params only, no let, no quoted lists yet) and documented as such. Zero impact on fpga-lisp path: full regression clean.")))
